<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Slow</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 9), Conjurer (guild level 15)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast slow &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast slow</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>Clouds the target's mind so they fight more slowly, striking less often. The 
better your mind sphere, the longer it lasts: from half a minute to almost 
two minutes.
</p><p>The target resists with their mind, and the spell may fail. Either way, 
casting it is an attack and starts a fight. Slow, haste and quicken replace 
each other, so a slow also takes away the target's haste or quicken (and 
either of those lifts the slow again). It is also found on wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Haste</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Quicken</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Drowse</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>